{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-github#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-github","commit":"de79037b6fdca2b993d977756c00acaed238b3ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github 是面向 DSH Web 与 CLI 的 GitHub 集成插件，注册工具和命令，让 agent 读取、搜索并管理仓库、PR 与 issue。它支持静态或模型辅助的后台 PR 审查、汇总或行内评论，以及可选的 CI 轮询机器人、状态检查门禁和 JSON/Markdown 报告。写操作经过审批。需要 GitHub token，可从配置、凭证、环境变量或 gh CLI 获取；CI 复合动作还需要 DeepSeek API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:91-114","src/ci/pipeline.ts:354-452","src/credential.ts:55-108"]}
